  m_Name: Lab Dialogue Database
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Features.Core.Settings.DialogueDatabase
  Dialogues:
  - Id: 0
    Lines:
    - supersoldier gas test 13D21
    - test subjects are lab rat and first human being
    - initializing in 3... 2... 1...
  - Id: 1
    Lines:
    - Test subject rat shows muscle grouth and agression
    - test subject human is dead
    - should continue testing on animals to achive stable formula
  - Id: 2
    Lines:
    - Hi there! Hope I didn't scare ya!
    - We've heard of your exploits. The way you handled the drone factory was incredibly
      cool, but unfortunately, they have a couple more drone manufacturing facilities
      that you'll encounter on your way.
    - These people are developing some kind of drug that will be capable of turning
      animals and people into weapons of war.
    - "Currently, they are testing this drug on us\u2014the rats. Sometimes, some
      of us manage to escape during a poorly conducted experiment."
    - But we are running out of time now, go to the lab and save more animals! We
      will talk later...
